---
---
<section id="features" class="section-pad">
	<div class="container">

		<div class="text-center mb-5 reveal">
			<h2 class="section-title mx-auto max-w-[560px]">
				Built for how<br>fans actually watch.
			</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="row g-4">
			<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 reveal reveal-delay-1">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<i class="bi bi-collection-play feature-icon"></i>
					<h3>Twelve leagues. One extension.</h3>
					<p>NBA, NFL, MLB, NHL, MLS, EPL, FIFA World Cup, WNBA, NCAAB, NCAAW, NCAAF, NCAAMH — monitored simultaneously, all the time.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 reveal reveal-delay-2">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat feature-icon"></i>
					<h3>Set it once. Watch everything.</h3>
					<p>Open your streams, assign them to games, walk away. ArenaSwap handles every switch from that point on.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 reveal reveal-delay-3">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<i class="bi bi-graph-up feature-icon"></i>
					<h3>See why. Every time.</h3>
					<p>Five signals power every score. Open any game to see the live breakdown, PowerScore trend, score history, and margin chart. No black-box guessing.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3 reveal reveal-delay-4">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<i class="bi bi-sliders feature-icon"></i>
					<h3>Your rules. Your game.</h3>
					<p>Dial sensitivity up or down, set a cooldown, boost games with your favorite teams, and filter to the leagues you care about.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>
</section>
